      "value": "<div><p><em>Wondrous Item, Common</em></p></div><blockquote><p>This copper amulet contains tiny interlocking gears and is powered by magic from Mechanus, a plane of clockwork predictability. Faint ticking and whirring noises emanate from within.</p></blockquote><p>When you make an attack roll while wearing the amulet, you can forgo rolling the d20 to get a 10 on the die. Once used, this property can’t be used again until the next dawn.</p>",
